Sim: hiv, as 10,360 agents, each 762 people, years 1985 to 2021
  Running as agents: P.time_in is a clock, which only agents keep
  Note: the beta of "hiv.infection" names mfnetwork, swnetwork, sexualnet, sexualnetwork, msm, msmscalefreenetwork, which are not routes of the sim, so they are not used; the routes are structuredsexual, prenatalnet, and those not named take the default
  Note: the beta of "hiv.mtct_postnatal" names breastfeedingnet, which is not a route of the sim, so it is not used; the routes are structuredsexual, prenatalnet, and those not named take the default
  Note: the dwell time of "post_art_death" comes from post_art_dwell, whose numbers are read in months, the sim's unit; if they are in another unit, give it on the distribution, e.g. unit="month"
  Note: consider a shorter step (e.g. dt=ss.months(0.25)): each step is 1 month, and people leave acute after 1.7 months on average, so 44% leave in a step. Taking whole steps, agents may differ from the ODE by an amount of that order; sim.check_dt() shows how much it matters
  Note: pregnancy: women pregnant at the start, conceived over the 9 steps before it (burnin=True)
